; cluster for laya (rhythm) concepts: laya, vriddhi-laya, kshaya-laya, thaalam.
; laya is time structured into repeating cycles — kaala made musical.
; vriddhi (increase) and kshaya (decrease) are the two directions of tempo change.
; sangati roots

(kosha laya-varga
  (vishesa sangeetham-varga)
  (swarupa subanta kaala)
  (yukta avrti spanda krama seema))
